            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Scriberman 1.0.2</h2>
<h3>What’s new</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Record and Stop controls are now clearer and provide visual feedback when hovered.</li>
  <li>Session titles are easier to recognize and edit across new, active, and completed recordings.</li>
  <li>The New Session button now stays out of the way while creating or recording a session.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
